category: Libs
requires: libdee1.0_4 libglib2.0-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "DBus Model-View-Controller object library (development)"
ldesc: "Libdee is a library that uses DBus to provide objects allowing you
to create Model-View-Controller type programs across DBus. It also consists of
utility objects which extend DBus allowing for peer-to-peer discoverability of
known objects without needing a central registrar."
external-source: dee

